From: Marc Lainez <marc.lainez@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] libcamera: ipa: simple: manual exposure, gain and white balance

The soft IPA only ran automatic exposure and white balance, so the
ExposureTime, AnalogueGain and ColourGains an application set were
ignored. Accept them with their modes and AwbEnable: manual values are
held, and auto exposure regulates whichever of exposure and gain is
still automatic.

The gain is a multiplier, so add sensor helpers for the Fairphone 3+
Samsung sensors, whose analogue gain code 32 is 1x.

Assisted-by: Claude:claude-opus-5-5
---
diff -ru a/src/ipa/libipa/camera_sensor_helper.cpp b/src/ipa/libipa/camera_sensor_helper.cpp
--- a/src/ipa/libipa/camera_sensor_helper.cpp
+++ b/src/ipa/libipa/camera_sensor_helper.cpp
@@ -554,6 +554,28 @@
